        "# Asynchronous context manager\n",
        "\n",
        "An asynchronous context manager implements `__aenter__` and `__aexit__`, allowing setup and cleanup to suspend. Use it with `async with`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-asynchronous-context-manager)"
      ]
    }
